{"id":1322,"date":"2020-09-02T11:10:15","date_gmt":"2020-09-02T11:10:15","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/?p=1322"},"modified":"2021-05-31T08:25:01","modified_gmt":"2021-05-31T08:25:01","slug":"mikroplasty-v-desti","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/mikroplasty-v-desti\/","title":{"rendered":"Mikroplasty v de\u0161ti"},"content":{"rendered":"\t\t<div data-elementor-type=\"wp-post\" data-elementor-id=\"1322\" class=\"elementor elementor-1322\" data-elementor-post-type=\"post\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<section class=\"elementor-section elementor-top-section elementor-element elementor-element-35e91d8 elementor-section-boxed elementor-section-height-default elementor-section-height-default\" data-id=\"35e91d8\" data-element_type=\"section\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-container elementor-column-gap-default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-column elementor-col-100 elementor-top-column elementor-element elementor-element-6db1ae3\" data-id=\"6db1ae3\" data-element_type=\"column\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-wrap elementor-element-populated\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-d0a3031 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"d0a3031\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>P\u0159\u00edtomnost plast\u016f v oce\u00e1nech a ve sladkovodn\u00edm prost\u0159ed\u00ed je dob\u0159e zn\u00e1m\u00fd a v posledn\u00edch letech intenzivn\u011b zkouman\u00fd jev. Prvo\u0159ad\u00e9 je odhalen\u00ed p\u016fvodu mikroplast\u016f a zmapov\u00e1n\u00ed jejich cesty v r\u016fzn\u00fdch ekosyst\u00e9mech. Toto dobrodru\u017estv\u00ed ov\u0161em za\u010d\u00edn\u00e1 detekc\u00ed a co nejp\u0159esn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed identifikac\u00ed t\u011bchto l\u00e1tek v rozli\u010dn\u00fdch typech vzork\u016f: pitn\u00e9 vod\u011b, u\u017eitkov\u00e9 vod\u011b, produktech potravin\u00e1\u0159sk\u00e9ho pr\u016fmyslu a tak\u00e9 v ovzdu\u0161\u00ed. Podle nov\u00e9 studie publikovan\u00e9 v \u010dasopise\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/science.sciencemag.org\/content\/368\/6496\/1257.abstract\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Science<\/a>\u00a0je toti\u017e zne\u010di\u0161t\u011bn\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/analyza-mikroplastu\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">mikroplasty<\/a>\u00a0r\u016fzn\u00fdch typ\u016f\u00a0 tak\u00e9 vzduch. Mikroskopick\u00e9 a nanoskopick\u00e9 \u010d\u00e1stice cestuj\u00ed pomoc\u00ed v\u011btru a z nebe se op\u011bt dost\u00e1vaj\u00ed do na\u0161eho \u017eivotn\u00edho prost\u0159ed\u00ed pravd\u011bpodobn\u011b v kapk\u00e1ch de\u0161t\u011b. \u010cl\u00e1nek s n\u00e1zvem \u201e<a href=\"https:\/\/science.sciencemag.org\/content\/368\/6496\/1257.abstract\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Plastic rain in protected areas of the United States<\/a>\u201c uv\u00e1d\u00ed n\u00e1lez plast\u016f v 98 procentech z 339 vzork\u016f shrom\u00e1\u017ed\u011bn\u00fdch z \u00fadajn\u011b zne\u010di\u0161t\u011bn\u00edm nedot\u010den\u00fdch oblast\u00ed v USA, a to v\u010detn\u011b 11 n\u00e1rodn\u00edch park\u016f (Rocky Mountain, Grand Canyon atd.).<\/p><p>Spoluautorem studie je Dr. Suja Sukumaran (vedouc\u00ed aplika\u010dn\u00ed v\u011bdec v divizi Spectroscopy Business Unit TFS) pou\u017e\u00edvaj\u00edc\u00ed mikroskop\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/produkt\/mikroskop-in10\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Thermo Scientific Nicolet iN10 FT-IR<\/a>\u00a0jako prim\u00e1rn\u00ed analytick\u00fd n\u00e1stroj pro\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2019\/03\/General-MicroPlastics-Guide.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">identifikaci plast\u016f<\/a>.<\/p><p>V\u00edce nap\u0159.\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.nytimes.com\/2020\/06\/11\/climate\/airborne-plastic-pollution.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">The New York Times<\/a>,\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.newsweek.com\/grand-canyon-joshua-tree-microplastics-atmosphere-scientists-1510251\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Newsweek<\/a>\u00a0a\u00a0<a href=\"https:\/\/www.wired.com\/story\/plastic-rain-is-the-new-acid-rain\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">WIRED<\/a>.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-c20678f dce_masking-none elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"c20678f\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"534\" src=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/f1c5216d-1024x683.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-1324\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/f1c5216d-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/f1c5216d-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/f1c5216d-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/f1c5216d-1536x1025.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/app\/uploads\/2021\/01\/f1c5216d.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<\/section>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>P\u0159\u00edtomnost plast\u016f v oce\u00e1nech a ve sladkovodn\u00edm prost\u0159ed\u00ed je dob\u0159e zn\u00e1m\u00fd a v posledn\u00edch letech intenzivn\u011b zkouman\u00fd jev. Prvo\u0159ad\u00e9 je odhalen\u00ed p\u016fvodu mikroplast\u016f a zmapov\u00e1n\u00ed jejich cesty v r\u016fzn\u00fdch ekosyst\u00e9mech. Toto dobrodru\u017estv\u00ed ov\u0161em za\u010d\u00edn\u00e1 detekc\u00ed a co nejp\u0159esn\u011bj\u0161\u00ed identifikac\u00ed t\u011bchto l\u00e1tek v rozli